### ─── Inventory Movements & Adjustments (PMS-006) ───────────────────────────
### Uses the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
###
### Quick start:
###   1. Start the API:  npm start
###   2. Send "Login as Pharmacist" and "Login as Admin" below.
###   3. Get a product id and lot id (see DISCOVERY requests).
###   4. Walk through request -> approve -> list movements.
###
### All routes require a Bearer access token and ADMIN or PHARMACIST role.
### Only ADMIN can approve or reject an adjustment.
###
### Endpoints covered:
###   POST   /inventory-movements/adjustments              Request a manual adjustment (pharmacist/admin)
###   GET    /inventory-movements/adjustments              List adjustment requests
###   GET    /inventory-movements/adjustments/:id          Get one adjustment request
###   POST   /inventory-movements/adjustments/:id/approve  Approve & apply (ADMIN only)
###   POST   /inventory-movements/adjustments/:id/reject   Reject (ADMIN only)
###   GET    /inventory-movements                          List immutable movement ledger
###   GET    /inventory-movements/:id                      Get one movement

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH — log in as a pharmacist (requests adjustments) and an admin
### (approves / rejects). A cashier token is included to show that
### non-privileged roles are rejected.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginPharmacist
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Login as Admin ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ── Login as Cashier ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name loginCashier
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "cashier@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ── Store tokens for later requests ─────────────────────────────────────

@pharmToken = {{loginPharmacist.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@cashierToken = {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}


### Variables to fill in from previous responses / seeded data:
@productId = PRODUCT_UUID
@lotId = LOT_UUID
@adjustmentId = ADJUSTMENT_UUID
@movementId = MOVEMENT_UUID


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DISCOVERY — look up product and lot ids to fill the bodies below.
### Replace PRODUCT_UUID and LOT_UUID with real values.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

GET {{base}}/lots?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REQUEST A MANUAL ADJUSTMENT — increase stock
### Expect: 201 (status PENDING, stock NOT yet changed)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name adjIncrease
POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotId}}",
  "quantity": 10,
  "direction": "INCREASE",
  "reason": "Physical count surplus"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REQUEST A MANUAL ADJUSTMENT — decrease stock
### Expect: 201 (status PENDING)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name adjDecrease
POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotId}}",
  "quantity": 5,
  "direction": "DECREASE",
  "reason": "Damaged units removed from shelf"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### VALIDATION — quantity must be >= 1
### Expect: 400
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotId}}",
  "quantity": 0,
  "direction": "INCREASE",
  "reason": "Invalid quantity"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### VALIDATION — direction must be INCREASE or DECREASE
### Expect: 400
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotId}}",
  "quantity": 3,
  "direction": "SIDEWAYS",
  "reason": "Invalid direction"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FORBIDDEN — pharmacist cannot approve/reject, cashier has no access at all
### Expect: 403
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}

POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotId}}",
  "quantity": 5,
  "direction": "INCREASE",
  "reason": "Cashier has no role access"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST ADJUSTMENT REQUESTS (all)
### Expect: 200 + paginated { data, total, page, pageSize, totalPages }
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name listAdjustments
GET {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FILTER ADJUSTMENTS — only PENDING for a given lot
### status: PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments?status=PENDING&lotId={{lotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GET ONE ADJUSTMENT
### Expect: 200, or 404 if id unknown
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### APPROVE & APPLY A PENDING ADJUSTMENT (ADMIN only)
### Locks the row, writes an immutable MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT movement and updates
### lot stock in one serializable transaction.
### Expect: 200 + { adjustment, movement }
### 409 if already processed (ADJUSTMENT_ALREADY_PROCESSED)
### 409 if approver == requester (ADJUSTMENT_SELF_APPROVAL)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name approveAdjustment
POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### APPROVE A DECREASING ADJUSTMENT WITH INSUFFICIENT STOCK
### Same endpoint — if DECREASE quantity > lot current stock the transaction
### rolls back.
### Expect: 409 (INSUFFICIENT_LOT_STOCK)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REJECT A PENDING ADJUSTMENT (ADMIN only)
### Expect: 200 + adjustment (status REJECTED, no movement written)
### 409 if already processed
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name rejectAdjustment
POST {{base}}/inventory-movements/adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST INVENTORY MOVEMENTS (immutable ledger)
### Optional filters: productId, lotId, movementType, userId, page, pageSize
### movementType: PURCHASE | SALE | RETURN | CANCELLATION | DAMAGE | EXPIRED |
###               THEFT_LOSS | MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT | ENTRY | EXIT | ADJUSTMENT |
###               TRANSFER
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name listMovements
GET {{base}}/inventory-movements?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FILTER MOVEMENTS — by lot
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements?lotId={{lotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FILTER MOVEMENTS — by product and type
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements?productId={{productId}}&movementType=MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FILTER MOVEMENTS — by user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements?userId=USER_UUID&movementType=SALE
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GET ONE MOVEMENT
### Expect: 200, or 404 if id unknown
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/inventory-movements/{{movementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### END-TO-END WORKED EXAMPLE (PMS-006 happy path)
### Adjust a lot DOWN by 4 units, then verify the ledger.
###   1. Send "Login as Pharmacist" and "Login as Admin".
###   2. Fill in @productId / @lotId with real values from DISCOVERY.
###   3. Send "REQUEST A MANUAL ADJUSTMENT — decrease stock".
###   4. Copy its response .body.id into @adjustmentId.
###   5. Send "APPROVE & APPLY" (admin) → returns adjustment + movement.
###   6. Send "FILTER MOVEMENTS — by lot" → new MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT row present.
###   7. Check the lot: currentQty dropped by the adjustment quantity.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
